<h2>Change a group from the command line</h2>
<p>Any group option can be overridden for one run with <code>--set</code>. See <a href="profiles.html">Profiles and --set</a>.</p>
<cb lang="bash">$ npx bddr run --set groups.checkout.mode=serial</cb>
<aside class="callout tip"><p class="callout-title">Tip</p><p>A scenario's own tags win over its group, and a group wins over a command-line flag. For example, <code>@retry:3</code> on a scenario beats <code>--retry 1</code>.</p></aside>
